# Trainer Create

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/trainer/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"Trainer7",
    "email":"Trainer7@gmail.com",
    "password":"Trainer7@123",
    "phone":"111111111"
}

# trainer get profile details

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/trainer/profile/get/me/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic Trainer1:Trainer1@123


# Trainer update profile details

###
PUT   http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/trainer/profile/complete/
Content-Type:  application/json
Authorization: Basic Trainer1:Trainer1@123

{
  
  "trainer_name": "yacob",
  "qualification": "Phd",
  "language": "python",
  "experiance_year": "13"

}